.TH "nvme_init_set_features_fdp" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_fdp" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_fdp \- Initialize passthru command for Flexible Data Placement
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_fdp
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "__u16 endgid "  ","
.BI "__u8 fdpcidx "  ","
.BI "bool fdpe "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "endgid" 12
Endurance Group Identifier (ENDGID)
.IP "fdpcidx" 12
Flexible Data Placement Configuration Index (FDPCIDX)
.IP "fdpe" 12
Flexible Data Placement Enable (FDPE)
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_FDP
